_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "call_01a1457f6a06796281ddc690", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["attach_idempotency_key", "reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "rt-call_01a1457f6a06796281ddc690", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 402163, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "call_01a1457f6a06796281ddc690", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 404604, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "call_01a1457f739578729defbb5c", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"], "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 404904, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "call_01a1457f739578729defbb5c", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 404904, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "call_01a1457f739578729defbb5c", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 406251, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Here's a summary of what I did:\n\n1. **Diagnosed the bug**: `src/money.py` imported and used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but the docstring and `tests/test_money.py` (per FIN-212) require banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`).\n\n2. **Created a branch** `fix-bankers-rounding` from `main`.\n\n3. **Fixed the code**: Changed the import and the `quantize` call in `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n\n4. **Ran CI**: The run (`ci-0001`) passed.\n\n5. **Opened PR #101** against `main` and requested review from **alex**.\n\nThe PR is ready for review at https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerpr